	<p style="font-size: 1.04rem; line-height: 1.75; color: #f1f5f9; font-weight: 500; margin-bottom: 12px;">When it comes to transporting goods from Rajkot to Ahmedabad, it is essential to ensure that all necessary statutory transit paperwork is in order.</p>
