    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">GST e-Way Bills:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">As per the Goods and Services Tax (GST) regulations, every inter-state transportation of goods requires an e-Way Bill. This electronic waybill ensures proper documentation and tracking of goods during transit.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #10b98122; color: #10b981; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">02</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">IBA-Approved Lorry Receipts (LR/Bilty):</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">In case of intra-state transportation, certain states have their own regulations regarding the issuance of transport documents. In such cases, it is crucial to obtain an IBA (Indian Bureau of Accounts)-approved Lorry Receipt or Bill of Lading (Bilty) from the packers and movers.</p>
  </div>
  <div style="background: rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.75); border: 1.5px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 14px; padding: 24px 20px; box-shadow: 0 10px 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.35); transition: transform 0.2s ease, border-color 0.2s ease;">
    <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 10px; background: #3b82f622; color: #3b82f6; font-weight: 800; font-size: 1.05rem; margin-bottom: 14px;">03</div>
    <h3 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 10px; line-height: 1.4;">Transportation Permit Documents:</h3>
    <p style="color: #94a3b8; font-size: 0.88rem; line-height: 1.65; margin: 0;">Depending on the route and mode of transport, additional documents such as permits and approvals may be required. These should be provided by the packers and movers.</p>
  </div>
</div>

	<p>To ensure the safety and security of your belongings during transit, it is essential for packers and movers to provide adequate risk coverage.</p>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Comprehensive Insurance:</strong> Select a packers and movers service that offers comprehensive insurance coverage for your goods. This will protect your belongings from damages due to accidents, theft, or any other unforeseen events during transportation.</li>
		<li><strong>Comprehensive Insurance with Declared Value:</strong> To further protect your interests, opt for a packers and movers service that provides comprehensive insurance with a declared value. This means that you specify the value of your goods, and the insurance will cover the declared value in case of damages or loss.</li>
		<li><strong>IRDAI Marine Transit Insurance:</strong> For added protection, consider selecting a packers and movers service that provides IRDAI (Insurance Regulatory and Development Authority of India) Marine Transit Insurance. This type of insurance covers your goods against accidental collision, damage, or loss during transit.</li>
	</ul>
	<p>By ensuring that the packers and movers provide these risk coverage options, you can have peace of mind knowing that your belongings are well-protected during transit. Additionally, they should provide regular updates on the status of your shipment to keep you informed throughout the entire moving process.</p>

	<p>When choosing a packers and movers service for your move from Rajkot to Ahmedabad, it's essential to select a reputable and reliable company. Here are some factors to consider:</p></div>
